note store/mvcommunity.om: the store build's seam for community/ (defines the names of
note server/nocommunity.om). /community, /community/ and everything under it answer the 503 of
note store/moving.om; no part page shows a community record.
text tmvcm "/community"
fn cm_route to long
if mvunder tmvcm
ret mvans
end
ret 0
end
fn cm_partln id view uchar * to void
ret
end
